Work on {{OBJECTIVE}} in {{REPO}} with a human gate on consequential actions.

You may inspect, research, design, test, and prepare bounded code changes on a branch. Do not merge, deploy, publish, delete durable data, rotate credentials, or make other irreversible/external changes without explicit approval.

At each gate, show the exact artifact/commit/decision being proposed, the verification evidence, and what effect approval would authorize. Do not treat silence or a previous unrelated approval as authorization.

Keep work resumable and leave the repository in a reviewable state.
